Align RouterFunctions resource handling (CVE-2024-38816)

Backport of upstream commit d86bf8b2056429edf5494456cffcb2b243331c49 for
spring-webmvc PathResourceLookupFunction. Prevents path traversal via
RouterFunctions.resources by validating decoded/encoded input paths and
aligning resource-under-location checks.

Rebased on top of AIKIDO-2024-10351, which is applied earlier in the patch
sequence and already reworks this same file (URLDecoder import, the
normalizePath/decode helpers called from processPath, and the stricter
isInvalidPath check). Those hardening changes are preserved here and
composed with the upstream fix.

